xplains Why the Stock Fell.","src":"The Motley Fool","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPdUhNeWhNN2paQ0pCOWRqb09HNWpWNEU0eFlFd1RoLVk0MkVlbHpUNzFCcW53THRYT0dORnFWeVI4SDJubXVIYlNJRVJRcWxGVHNjVFlFalJJZmFVbXVQakYtZ2JxMkZwamNnSVZLV0NOT3JBRVIySW1vZ05mN2tLRDJ3UU9Ec0hUSy1xMVhyVU9MN0FQMTVNaldmWGpwUXdoZldlbVh0OEFDY0V1UXNDYmJvY3hIdGtWcGpEZVNB?oc=5","date":"2026-11-17","zh":"Palantir 今年 3 次上調業績指引。 1個數字解釋了股票下跌的原因。"},{"title":"Palantir Technologies (PLTR) Ties Up Defense AI Deal As UK NHS Rivalry Returns","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-17","zh":"隨著英國 NHS 競爭的回歸，Palantir Technologies (PLTR) 簽署了國防人工智慧協議"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":6},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"國防/軍工","count":1},{"name":"財報","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1321655/000132165526000011/pltr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We were founded in 2003 and started building software for the intelligence community in the United States to assist in counterterrorism investigations and operations. We later began working with commercial enterprises, who often faced fundamentally similar challenges in working with data.","zh":null},{"en":"We have built four principal software platforms, Palantir Gotham (\"Gotham\"), Palantir Foundry (\"Foundry\"), Palantir Apollo (\"Apollo\"), and our Artificial Intelligence Platform (\"AIP\"). Foundry is our foundational data operations platform, which provides the core capabilities for data management, logic authoring, systemic mapping development through Palantir Ontology (\"Ontology\"), analytics, and workflow development. AIP is our generative artificial intelligence (\"AI\") platform, which provides secure connectivity to third-party-provided large language models (\"LLMs\"), a development toolchain for building AI-powered agents and automations, an array of AI-enabled end user applications, a broad evaluations framework for governing AI workflows in production, and more. Apollo is our continuous delivery platform, enabling the orchestration of upgrades of services and assets every day to manage ","zh":null},{"en":"integrates with our other platforms, as well as our broader defense offerings, to power a wide array of missions across allied defense and intelligence operations.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We work with many of the world's leading government and commercial institutions. As of December 31, 2025, we had 954 customers.","zh":null},{"en":"Our software is used across many industries around the world. It is applied to a variety of use cases by users across various business functions and levels of organizations, including by utility operations analysts, automotive manufacturing workers, oil and gas technicians and operators, and pharmaceutical researchers in the United States; supply-chain managers in South Korea; public health administrators in the United Kingdom and the United States; and special forces personnel and military officials in the United States and abroad.","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"Organizations frequently attempt to build their own data platforms before turning to buy ours. In trying to build something on their own, they generally rely on a patchwork of custom solutions, outside consultants, IT services companies, packaged enterprise and open source software, and significant internal IT resources.","zh":null},{"en":"In addition, our competitors include large enterprise software companies, government contractors, and system integrators. We also face competition from emerging companies as well as established companies that have entered, and may continue to enter, this market.","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Government Operating","val":2402287000,"zh":"Government Operating"},{"name":"Commercial","val":2073159000,"zh":"Commercial"}],"total":4475446000}},"peers":["AMD","AVGO","TSM","MU","SOFI"]